  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Bronze IP stainless steel case with a black silicone strap. Fixed black ceramic bezel. Bronze dial with bronze hands and index hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 4 o'clock position. Three sub-dials displaying:  60 second, 30 minute and day. Quartz movement. Scratch resistant K1 crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 44 mm. Tang clasp. Water resistant at 50 meters / 165 feet. Functions: chronograph, date, day, hour, minute, second. Bold Fusion Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Movado Bold Fusion Chronograph Bronze Dial Quartz Men's Watch 3600854.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Movado</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Bold Fusion</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">3600854</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Movement</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Quartz</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom